 sledge became arduous  but all in all it was a satisfactory  solution  the black stream pounded downward  carrying water from beyond oni's village  to his own  sustaining life along its fertile banks  the tips of the mountains above him were  a glow from the unseen sun by the time  he cited the first of the dark  structures of oni's village  the place looked exactly the same as it  had when he'd left it what seemed to be  years ago  the houses were crippled and desolate  the only signs of life the ubiquitous  bluebells that climbed around fence  posts and carpeted the neglected lawns  manny wanted to call out to oni but the  whispering voices seemed to push in  around him  suppressing his speech he had forgotten  how terrible they were when oni wasn't  around to control them  he stood in the center of the snug ring  of houses his hands still clutching the  rope that had pulled the sled  he wondered if oni was in one of the  houses looking out at him  perhaps angry at how he had run away  yesterday  he made a slow circle squinting in vain  into the darkened windows of the  cottages  he gestured to the sled and then to  himself trying to make oni understand  that he had brought something for her  surely she couldn't refuse him after  she'd seen the bower  the ghostly voices echoed through the  narrow streets a cacophony of hostility  but a moment later the sound subsided  and manny saw oni emerging from a house  at the far end of the square  her expression seemed to be one of  bemusement but she did not speak as she  approached him  manny was nearly jumping up and down in  his excitement making nervous circles  around the laden sledge  oni stopped a few feet from him and  looked down at the bower her expression  didn't change  and manny was confused how could she not  be overwhelmed by the workmanship that  had gone into it  the artistry with which he had fashioned  the delicate chambers  he felt his face growing hot and his  smile tightened  perhaps she simply didn't understand the  enormity of this custom  the importance of what he was offering  he would have a great deal of work ahead  of him  oni he said a little impatiently when  she looked at him he reached up and took  her hand  with his other hand he pointed to the  bower you  manny and oni he pointed to himself  she smiled at him but her face still  betrayed puzzlement  you made this for me she gestured to  herself  manny nodded vigorously perhaps she  wasn't as stupid as he had supposed  oh she peered down into the front  chamber and her face lit up  there's grandfather's things i thought  you had just stolen them  she raised her head and fixed her gaze  on his you broke some of his vases  though  mandy wasn't sure what she was saying  but she seemed to have got the gist of  the situation  so he kept smiling when she had  straightened back up manny said  ceremony manny and oni he pressed his  palms flat against each other  male and female oh  oni's lovely eyes went wide and then she  laughed a joyous ringing sound  manny didn't know what she was laughing  at but she didn't sound cruel or  contemptuous  so he joined her and laughed her perhaps  she was just very happy  now that she had finally understood what  he offered  after a few moments oni's laughter faded  and she stood there  looking down at manny in the bower manny  stopped laughing abruptly  why was she just standing there at home  when the females accepted the offer of  the bower  they put their heads down in deference  and then crawled into the bower for the  final portion of the marriage ceremony  the ceiling of the pact  oni was standing there tall and proud  deferring to no one  what was the matter with her manny took  her hand again  as roughly as he would have if she had  been a recalcitrant child  and pointed insistently at the bower  when she still appeared not to  understand  manny was forced to squat down and mime  crawling in through the opening  at last comprehension dawned upon her  pretty face  i have to go inside she asked and manny  nodded  hoping she'd said what he thought she  had she was obviously not taking the  ceremony very seriously  and this made manny very angry this was  not how he had pictured his wedding  but then she was not of his people and  could not be expected to know everything  after the ceremony he would have to  coach her more on the correct way of  doing things  he was glad to see though that she had  at last bent over and crawled halfway  into the front chamber of the bower  it's awfully small in here she said her  voice muffled  and although manny felt an almost  irresistible urge to push her in  he was just able to restrain himself the  females always entered the bowers of  their own free will  oni's feet clad and furred boots were  all that was still visible  once more he heard her muffled and  amused voice  what do i do now go through here he  didn't answer  since it appeared that she'd already  opened the hinged panel and made her way  into the rear chamber  now he could see her through the iron  bars see her expression  which was rapidly going from amusement  to annoyance  this is a cage manny she said flatly  manny said nothing she looked at him  through the bars  a beautiful bird of paradise is that all  can i come out now  manny gave her a stern look then sat  cross-legged on the ground  gesturing for her to do the same she  sighed and mumbled something under her  breath  but sat on the floor of the cage tilting  her head and staring at him expectantly  normally at this point in the ceremony  the male would ask if the female was  ready for the final sealing of the pact  but as manny didn't know how to ask such  a thing in a way she would understand  he simply reached over and flipped the  lever that controlled the mechanism  beneath the cage  in a brief moment he thought his flesh  growing hot with anticipation  the machine would remove the now  vestigial penis from his bride  leaving only the vagina which now  belonged 